{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1510810001:0":{"text":"...무슨 소리지?","source_cn":"……外面有声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE714B1548D5E4D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510810002:0":{"text":"호들갑 떨지 마. 여긴 초소와 가까워서 밤에는 잠도 못 잘 정도라고.","source_cn":"很正常，这里离哨卡太近，晚上睡觉都睡不安稳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A606CDF98EAC5D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510810003:0":{"text":"아니. 심상치 않은 소리야.","source_cn":"不，不是寻常的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2A2436DB3614CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510810004:0":{"text":"보칼리스인들이... <style=\"highlight\">대열을 갖추고 있다고</style>!","source_cn":"那些呼临人……<style=highlight>在列队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E74252A5D21D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1510810004":{"text":"보칼리스인들이... <style=\"highlight\">대열을 갖추고 있다고</style>!","source_cn":"那些呼临人……<style=highlight>在列队</style>！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E74252A5D21D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510810005:1":{"text":"...<style=\"highlight\">바람늪 전장</style>으로 가야 해요. 그곳은 지세가 평탄해서 전쟁이 일어나면 양쪽 군대가 거기서 만나게 될 테니까요.","source_cn":"……我们该去<style=highlight>风沼战场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182D697125B0DD7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510810006:0":{"text":"제가 말했던 것처럼 사냥의 신의 출현은... 분명 이 전쟁에 무서운 변수를 가져올 거예요.","source_cn":"如我所言，狩猎神现世……必定会为战争带来极为可怕的变数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16CC79F2184E593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510810007:0":{"text":"뿔 달린 아쿠보르인, 넌 포위당할지도 모르니 여기 남아 있어. 지금 넌 공공의 적이니까.","source_cn":"长角的雅库伯尔人就别去了，免得被围攻。现在你可是两方的公敌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE992F9332DBFAD9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510810008:0":{"text":"젠장...!","source_cn":"你……！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x108BAE6D781DEAA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510810009:1":{"text":"갈라 님에겐 간병을 해줄 사람이 필요하니, 나페이, 당신은 여기 남아 동족을 잘 보살펴 주세요.","source_cn":"加拉尚需看护，那非，请照看好你的同族。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD98BA5D261805D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::0":{"text":"에코 스톤","source_cn":"传讯石","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B8E337414F1DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510810010:0":{"text":"그리고 필요하면 언제든 이 <style=\"highlight\">에코 스톤</style>으로 연락하세요.","source_cn":"请收下这块<style=highlight>传讯石</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52996572748FF8CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510810011:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">탁자 위의 크리스탈</style>도 눈여겨 봐 주시고요. 혹시라도 크리스탈에 무슨 변화가 생기면 바로 연락 주셔야 해요.","source_cn":"以及，麻烦你多加留意<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3E9B60C0BF2D3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510810012:0":{"text":"어떤 변화를 말하는 거지?","source_cn":"会有什么变化？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D053256499E41F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510810013:1":{"text":"저 크리스탈은 광범위한 마력의 흐름을 인식할 수 있어요. 변화의 순간이 오면 자연스레 알게 될 거예요.","source_cn":"它能识别大范围的魔力流动，若变化之刻来临，你必会知晓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFA3E6ECEEC7EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"